<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 17: </span><span id="A8.F17.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Uncurated generation results from Harmon-1.5B (top) and post-trained model (bottom)</span>. Prompt: A photo of a skis right of a zebra.</figcaption>
</figure>
