</figure>
<figure id="A8.F19" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.07295v1/x6.png" id="A8.F19.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:417/209;" width="417" height="209" alt="Refer to caption">
